REUSE vs FREE composition at EQUAL COMPUTE: does heterogeneity beat the reuse heuristic?
N=24 K=3, dilations {1,2,3}, up to L=6, 24 seeds, target 0.85
REUSE enumerates uniform (dilation,depth) with 8 restarts; FREE runs a GA over arbitrary
dilation sequences -- budgets matched (~equal candidate trainings). Rank: solve-rate, then
energy (block count) among solved. Winner needs to actually SOLVE, then be cheaper.

